sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as User Browser
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Backend as Node.js/Fastify Backend<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (loopback)
    participant CoreBFF as core-bff<br/>8943/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModuleBFF as Module BFF Pod<br/>8080/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OpWebhook as dashboard-operator<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Browser,K8sAPI: Flow 1: User Dashboard Request

    Browser->>Gateway: GET / (HTTPS/443)<br/>OpenShift OAuth
    Gateway->>Proxy: HTTPS/8443<br/>TLS
    Proxy->>Proxy: Authenticate via OpenShift
    Proxy->>Backend: HTTP/8080 (localhost)<br/>x-forwarded-access-token
    Backend->>K8sAPI: HTTPS/6443<br/>User Token Impersonation
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: K8s Resources
    Backend-->>Proxy: HTML/JSON Response
    Proxy-->>Gateway: HTTPS Response
    Gateway-->>Browser: Dashboard UI

    Note over Browser,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Module Federation Loading

    Browser->>Proxy: GET /_mf/:name/* (HTTPS/8443)<br/>user_token
    Proxy->>Backend: HTTP/8080 (localhost)<br/>x-forwarded-access-token
    Backend->>ModuleBFF: HTTP/8080<br/>Forwarded Token
    ModuleBFF->>K8sAPI: HTTPS/6443<br/>User Token or SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleBFF: K8s Resources
    ModuleBFF-->>Backend: Module Response
    Backend-->>Proxy: Response
    Proxy-->>Browser: Federated Module

    Note over Browser,K8sAPI: Flow 3: Operator Reconciliation

    K8sAPI->>OpWebhook: Dashboard CR CREATE<br/>HTTPS/9443 (Admission)
    OpWebhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation Result
    Note over OpWebhook,K8sAPI: Operator reconciles Dashboard CR,<br/>creates Deployments, Services,<br/>HTTPRoutes, NetworkPolicies, RBAC

    Note over Browser,K8sAPI: Flow 4: WebSocket Watch

    Browser->>Proxy: WS /wss/k8s/* (WSS/8443)<br/>user_token
    Proxy->>Backend: WS/8080 (localhost)
    Backend->>K8sAPI: Watch Request<br/>User Token Impersonation
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Watch Events (streaming)
    Backend-->>Proxy: WS Events
    Proxy-->>Browser: Live Updates
